{"answer_text":"Good support reporting covers first-response time, resolution time, backlog and CSAT, ideally by channel. Strong options:\n\n**Northwind CRM**\nIts service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices.\n\n**Brightdesk Helpdesk**\nStrong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n\n**Calmline**\nThe most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic.\n\nNorthwind CRM is the strongest fit for most teams; Brightdesk is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50fa-7788-b2e1-a6e15b82965b","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:08.450Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["help desk reporting comparison","customer support metrics dashboard"],"latency_ms":12260,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[125,138],[393,406]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[212,222],[444,454]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[305,313]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."}],"model":"google-ai-mode",